    "reading-passage": {
      "nodeId": "542:1097",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "📖 Reading Passage",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "📖 Reading Passage"
        },
        {
          "text": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Bedroom",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Level: B1 · Topic: The Bedroom"
        },
        {
          "text": "My New Bedroom\n\nWhen I moved into my new flat last month, the bedroom was completely empty. The first thing I bought was a comfortable bed with a wooden bed frame and a soft mattress. I put two pillows and a duvet on top, with clean white sheets and a warm blanket for cold nights.\n\nNext to the bed, I placed a small nightstand with a lamp and an alarm clock. On the other side of the room, I set up a dresser with six drawers for my clothes. I also bought a tall wardrobe for my jackets and shirts, and I keep a row of hangers inside for everything to stay neat.\n\nIn the corner, I have a desk and a chair where I study. My laptop, charger, and headphones sit on the desk. Above the desk, I hung a bookshelf for my books and a few photo albums. The wall has a poster and a picture frame with a family photo.\n\nI chose soft curtains for the window and added blinds for privacy. There is a small rug on the floor beside the bed, and a ceiling light with a dimmer connected to the light switch by the door. On quiet evenings, I light a candle, put on my pajamas and slippers, and read before sleep. My bedroom is simple, but it feels like home.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "My New Bedroom When I moved into my new flat last month, the bedroom was completely empty. The first thing I bought was a comfortable bed with a wooden bed frame and a soft mattress. I put two pillows and a duvet on top, with clean white sheets and a warm blanket for cold nights. Next to the bed, I placed a small nightstand with a lamp and an alarm clock. On the other side of the room, I set up a dresser with six drawers for my clothes. I also bought a tall wardrobe for my jackets and shirts, and I keep a row of hangers inside for everything to stay neat. In the corner, I have a desk and a chair where I study. My laptop, charger, and headphones sit on the desk. Above the desk, I hung a bookshelf for my books and a few photo albums. The wall has a poster and a picture frame with a family photo. I chose soft curtains for the window and added blinds for privacy. There is a small rug on the floor beside the bed, and a ceiling light with a dimmer connected to the light switch by the door. On quiet evenings, I light a candle, put on my pajamas and slippers, and read before sleep. My bedroom is simple, but it feels like home."
        },
        {
          "text": "Comprehension Questions",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Comprehension Questions"
        },
        {
          "text": "1. What was the first piece of furniture the writer bought?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. What was the first piece of furniture the writer bought?"
        },
        {
          "text": "2. Where does the writer keep jackets and shirts?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. Where does the writer keep jackets and shirts?"
        },
        {
          "text": "3. What items are on the desk?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. What items are on the desk?"
        },
        {
          "text": "4. Why did the writer add blinds to the window?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. Why did the writer add blinds to the window?"
        },
        {
          "text": "5. What does the writer do on quiet evenings before sleep?",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. What does the writer do on quiet evenings before sleep?"
        }
      ]
    },
    "idioms-phrases": {
      "nodeId": "542:1110",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "💬 Idioms, Phrasal Verbs & Key Phrases"
        },
        {
          "text": "hit the sack / hit the hay",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "hit the sack / hit the hay"
        },
        {
          "text": "go to bed (informal)",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "go to bed (informal)"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I'm exhausted — I need to hit the sack.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I'm exhausted — I need to hit the sack.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "sleep like a log",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "sleep like a log"
        },
        {
          "text": "sleep very deeply without waking",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "sleep very deeply without waking"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"After the long hike, I slept like a log.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"After the long hike, I slept like a log.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "tuck in",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "tuck in"
        },
        {
          "text": "push the edges of sheets or blankets under the mattress",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "push the edges of sheets or blankets under the mattress"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"She tucked the children in and said goodnight.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"She tucked the children in and said goodnight.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "tidy up",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "tidy up"
        },
        {
          "text": "make a room clean and organised",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "make a room clean and organised"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I need to tidy up my bedroom before the guests arrive.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I need to tidy up my bedroom before the guests arrive.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "turn in",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "turn in"
        },
        {
          "text": "go to bed (informal)",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "go to bed (informal)"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"It's getting late — I think I'll turn in.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"It's getting late — I think I'll turn in.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "get up",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "get up"
        },
        {
          "text": "rise from bed, wake up",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "rise from bed, wake up"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I get up at 7 every morning for work.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I get up at 7 every morning for work.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "lie down",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "lie down"
        },
        {
          "text": "put your body flat, usually on a bed",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "put your body flat, usually on a bed"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"I felt dizzy, so I had to lie down for a while.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"I felt dizzy, so I had to lie down for a while.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "make the bed",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "make the bed"
        },
        {
          "text": "arrange sheets, blankets, and pillows neatly",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "arrange sheets, blankets, and pillows neatly"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"My mother always told me to make the bed every morning.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"My mother always told me to make the bed every morning.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "put away",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "put away"
        },
        {
          "text": "return items to their proper place",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "return items to their proper place"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Please put your clothes away in the wardrobe.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"Please put your clothes away in the wardrobe.\""
        },
        {
          "text": "a good night's sleep",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "a good night's sleep"
        },
        {
          "text": "restful, uninterrupted sleep",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "restful, uninterrupted sleep"
        },
        {
          "text": "\"All I need is a good night's sleep and I'll feel better.\"",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "\"All I need is a good night's sleep and I'll feel better.\""
        }
      ]
    },
