        {
          "text": "Scene: Two flatmates discussing bedroom furniture",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Scene: Two flatmates discussing bedroom furniture"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tom:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Tom:"
        },
        {
          "text": "I finally set up my new bed frame yesterday. It took me two hours!",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "I finally set up my new bed frame yesterday. It took me two hours!"
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisha:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Aisha:"
        },
        {
          "text": "That sounds tiring. Did you get a new mattress too?",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "That sounds tiring. Did you get a new mattress too?"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tom:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Tom:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, a memory foam one. And I bought a duvet and two soft pillows.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Yes, a memory foam one. And I bought a duvet and two soft pillows."
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisha:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Aisha:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Nice! What about storage? Your clothes were everywhere last week.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Nice! What about storage? Your clothes were everywhere last week."
        },
        {
          "text": "Tom:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Tom:"
        },
        {
          "text": "I know! I got a wardrobe and a chest of drawers. Now I can actually put my things away.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "I know! I got a wardrobe and a chest of drawers. Now I can actually put my things away."
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisha:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Aisha:"
        },
        {
          "text": "Great. And the lighting? That old ceiling light was really dim.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Great. And the lighting? That old ceiling light was really dim."
        },
        {
          "text": "Tom:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Tom:"
        },
        {
          "text": "I added a reading light on the nightstand and a desk lamp near my laptop. Much better now.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "I added a reading light on the nightstand and a desk lamp near my laptop. Much better now."
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisha:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Aisha:"
        },
        {
          "text": "It sounds like a proper bedroom now. Maybe I should tidy up mine too.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "It sounds like a proper bedroom now. Maybe I should tidy up mine too."
        },
        {
          "text": "Tom:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Tom:"
        },
        {
          "text": "You should! A nice rug, some curtains, maybe a plant — it makes a big difference.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "You should! A nice rug, some curtains, maybe a plant — it makes a big difference."
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisha:",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "Aisha:"
        },
        {
          "text": "You're right. A good bedroom really helps you get a good night's sleep.",
          "depth": 2,
          "name": "You're right. A good bedroom really helps you get a good night's sleep."
        }
      ]
