        {
          "text": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "🧩 Fill-in-the-Blank Exercises"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "Complete each sentence with a word from this page."
        },
        {
          "text": "1.  I keep my shirts and jackets in the __________.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "1. I keep my shirts and jackets in the __________."
        },
        {
          "text": "2.  The __________ clock woke me up at 6:30 this morning.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "2. The __________ clock woke me up at 6:30 this morning."
        },
        {
          "text": "3.  She put fresh __________ on the bed before the guests arrived.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "3. She put fresh __________ on the bed before the guests arrived."
        },
        {
          "text": "4.  I need a new __________ — my old one is too soft and I wake up with a sore back.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "4. I need a new __________ — my old one is too soft and I wake up with a sore back."
        },
        {
          "text": "5.  Please hang your coat on a __________ in the wardrobe.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "5. Please hang your coat on a __________ in the wardrobe."
        },
        {
          "text": "6.  He sat at his __________ to study for the exam.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "6. He sat at his __________ to study for the exam."
        },
        {
          "text": "7.  I closed the __________ because the sunlight was too strong.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "7. I closed the __________ because the sunlight was too strong."
        },
        {
          "text": "8.  My __________ has three drawers where I keep socks and underwear.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "8. My __________ has three drawers where I keep socks and underwear."
        },
        {
          "text": "9.  She placed a small __________ next to the bed and put a lamp on it.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "9. She placed a small __________ next to the bed and put a lamp on it."
        },
        {
          "text": "10. I put on my __________ and slippers before going to the kitchen.",
          "depth": 1,
          "name": "10. I put on my __________ and slippers before going to the kitchen."
        },
        {
          "text": "Answer Key",
          "depth": 2,
